=head1 NAME

APPS:DCpsft - Controls PeopleSoft Data Collections

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This module defines common settings for the following PeopleSoft
related-modules:

=over 3

=item o Tuxedo Application Server

=item o Process Scheduler

=item o Web Application Server

=back

